theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 16
text = "**To the Witch Who Doesn't Remember Me,**

You don't know who I am.

But I know you.

I know you've been waiting for something to break the endless repetition of your days.

So let me give you something to chase.

Deep in the forest, beyond the old ruins, there is a **silver key**.

Find it.

Bring it back to your home and place it beneath the candle on your table.

When you do, you will understand why I came looking for you.

And if you still want answers after that...

I'll give you another letter.

**—Someone you once knew**
"

